---
title: "publishTgeDetails (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator invokes publishTgeDetails(askToken, tokenDecimals)
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_active: sale has not ended
    q_revert_active --> [*]: revert SaleStillActive
    q_check_ended --> q_check_published: sale has ended
    q_check_published --> q_revert_dup: TGE details already published
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadyPublished
    q_check_published --> q_set: TGE details not yet published
    q_set --> [*]: askToken = askToken; tokenDecimals = tokenDecimals; emit TgeDetailsPublished()

    note right of q_check_ended
        INV-001: TGE details can only be published after sale ends (token deployed post-TGE)
        INV-002: askToken address set after actual token deployment
    end note
